I go out of the house.
Now I go to the bus stop.
The bus stop is near my building.
I go to the office by bus every day.
Now I am at the bus stop.
Other people are also here.
They are also going to the office.
There is a short line here.
Now I too stand in the line.
I wait for my BEST bus.
There are many vehicles on the road.
A bus arrives.
It is a red bus.
But it is not my bus.
So I wait again.
Now my BEST bus arrives.
The bus stops in front of me.
The line moves forward.
Now I enter the bus.
